      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The city was incorporated on July 1, 2001, becoming Nevada's newest municipality at that time.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fernley%2C_Nevada",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Newlands Reclamation Project irrigated roughly 300,000 acres, turning Fernley's arid land into productive farmland in the early 1900s.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        13,
        22
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
