      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/Fernley%2C_Nevada",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Fernley High School opened in the late 1950s, the town's first dedicated secondary school.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
